   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:30",
   "ordinal": 30,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 63000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: like to stay very involved in that regard, but I do have a full team of amazing women that are behind me as well."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:31",
   "ordinal": 31,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 71000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I couldn't do it myself."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:32",
   "ordinal": 32,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 73000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I'm based in Texas."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:33",
   "ordinal": 33,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 76000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Prior to being a digital advertising agency owner, which I've been doing now for six years, I had a 12-year career in Austin in the wedding and events industry, in sales and catering sales, event sales, things along those lines."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:34",
   "ordinal": 34,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 93000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So our call today really is just a casual conversation."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:35",
   "ordinal": 35,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 96000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It's a no-pressure call."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:36",
   "ordinal": 36,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 97000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It's a chance for us to get to know one another, get to know each other's businesses, kind of gauge and see if working together may be a good fit, and then kind of determine how to continue the conversation from there."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:37",
   "ordinal": 37,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 110000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah, that sounds wonderful."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:38",
   "ordinal": 38,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 112000,
   "text": "rose: Thanks, Whitney."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:39",
   "ordinal": 39,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 112000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:40",
   "ordinal": 40,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 113000,
   "text": "rose: Okay, so I would love to hear a little bit more from you, and you kind of already shared just a little bit."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:41",
   "ordinal": 41,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 120000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: About, you know, kind of what's piqued your interest with ads?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:42",
   "ordinal": 42,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 123000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Why now?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:43",
   "ordinal": 43,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 126000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So feel free to share more."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:44",
   "ordinal": 44,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 128000,
   "text": "rose: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:45",
   "ordinal": 45,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 129000,
   "text": "rose: So I, I, I've also been in the industry for six years."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:46",
   "ordinal": 46,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 133000,
   "text": "rose: I've been a photographer for six years."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:47",
   "ordinal": 47,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 135000,
   "text": "rose: I am before this had a career in like foreign policy."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:48",
   "ordinal": 48,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 140000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: was working internationally and when COVID happened, obviously that didn't work anymore."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:49",
   "ordinal": 49,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 145000,
   "text": "rose: So in 2020, I was like, all right, I'm going to start this wedding photography business in, at that point in time, I am in Colorado."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:50",
   "ordinal": 50,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 153000,
   "text": "rose: So predominantly like elopements, adventure elopements was jam."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:51",
   "ordinal": 51,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 157000,
   "text": "rose: Um, and what I've since sort of learned, I think in part through like becoming a parent and then in part, just like the natural sort of progression of how things are moving personally is that I'm more interested in doing like fewer higher end weddings that are."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:52",
   "ordinal": 52,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 180000,
   "text": "rose: Like more organized with a team and less of like, I have to organize everything with the elopements."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:53",
   "ordinal": 53,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 186000,
   "text": "rose: So what sort of is evolving and this has been happening somewhat organically through intention in the last 18 months is a transition from elopements to weddings."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:54",
   "ordinal": 54,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 199000,
   "text": "rose: Where I am finding the like difficulty in getting good leads is definitely because I have raised prices somewhat."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:55",
   "ordinal": 55,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 211000,
   "text": "rose: And then secondly is just a little bit of, I think I'm not connecting in the same way."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:56",
   "ordinal": 56,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 217000,
   "text": "rose: Like I'm having a hard time finding those clients."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:57",
   "ordinal": 57,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 220000,
   "text": "rose: And so a little bit of that is I think networking, a little bit of that is just like what I'm showing up as online."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:58",
   "ordinal": 58,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 227000,
   "text": "rose: So there could be a messaging issue there, but I also know that, you know, a well run ad can make a big difference for."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:59",
   "ordinal": 59,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 240000,
   "text": "rose: The visibility and the trust."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:60",
   "ordinal": 60,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 241000,
   "text": "rose: So I have run Google Ads in the past for kind of the elopement space and they have been somewhat successful."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:61",
   "ordinal": 61,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 250000,
   "text": "rose: They're just kept getting more and more expensive."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:62",
   "ordinal": 62,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 252000,
   "text": "rose: And I was like, this is just really eating into my profit."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:63",
   "ordinal": 63,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 258000,
   "text": "rose: Like I was, I would spend, you know, $900 and get one good lead."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:64",
   "ordinal": 64,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 262000,
   "text": "rose: And then it's like, oh man, that just, that's a lot, you know?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:65",
   "ordinal": 65,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 266000,
   "text": "rose: Um, so yes."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:66",
   "ordinal": 66,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 269000,
   "text": "rose: So now I'm kind of in this space of like, I would like to run, and the other part I should say is that I am not very like organized on the data side of like the ads."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:67",
   "ordinal": 67,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 283000,
   "text": "rose: And so I would like, I would see my click-through rates."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:68",
   "ordinal": 68,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 286000,
   "text": "rose: I would see my impressions and I would see, you know, I would know what my conversions are, but I would not necessarily be like beta testing this ad versus this ad."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:69",
   "ordinal": 69,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 296000,
   "text": "rose: And like seeing where the differences in the success."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:70",
   "ordinal": 70,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 300000,
   "text": "rose: And then like learning from that."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:71",
   "ordinal": 71,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 302000,
   "text": "rose: So that is something that, you know, I know a marketing agency would do and they would be able to say, okay, like this is what seems to be really working and this is not, this is where we need to put our efforts."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:72",
   "ordinal": 72,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 314000,
   "text": "rose: So, so yeah, I don't have much experience with Meta."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:73",
   "ordinal": 73,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 321000,
   "text": "rose: I have like boosted a post or two before, but nothing that's strategized."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:74",
   "ordinal": 74,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 326000,
   "text": "rose: So I am also struggling to, I think, connect with more Gen Z."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:75",
   "ordinal": 75,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 333000,
   "text": "rose: So I know that Meta is probably a useful platform more so than it was to me four years ago."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:76",
   "ordinal": 76,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 342000,
   "text": "rose: So yeah, all that's to say, you know, I, I know that ads are, you can spend good money running them."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:77",
   "ordinal": 77,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 351000,
   "text": "rose: I know that there is a good ROI if they're done correctly."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:78",
   "ordinal": 78,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 355000,
   "text": "rose: I just don't fully know how to do that."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:79",
   "ordinal": 79,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 360000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:80",
   "ordinal": 80,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 360000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:81",
   "ordinal": 81,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 361000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I hear you and totally understand."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:82",
   "ordinal": 82,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 364000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:83",
   "ordinal": 83,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 364000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Figuring out the ads piece of it can turn into a full-time job in and of itself."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:84",
   "ordinal": 84,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 370000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And when you're trying to kind of like do it alone or like DIY it, like a couple of things can happen, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:85",
   "ordinal": 85,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 377000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: You can really kind of like feel a bit in the dark and not really kind of know, is this working the way it should be?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:86",
   "ordinal": 86,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 382000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Is it not working the way it should be?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:87",
   "ordinal": 87,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 384000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Or it can also just turn into something where things slip through the cracks, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:88",
   "ordinal": 88,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 389000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Like you're a photographer, you have an actual business to run, not just like launching new ads, you know, every couple of weeks to be able to split test and try out new creatives and things like that."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:89",
   "ordinal": 89,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 400000,
   "text": "rose: So I hear you for sure."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:90",
   "ordinal": 90,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 403000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I'm glad that you mentioned the messaging piece of it."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:91",
   "ordinal": 91,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 405000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: That is so super important."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:92",
   "ordinal": 92,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 407000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And it's an area where we really spend a good amount of focus with on our clients really before we even launch ads, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:93",
   "ordinal": 93,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 418000,
   "text": "rose: Because."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:94",
   "ordinal": 94,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 420000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It's so important that, you know, the first touchpoint that people see with an ad resonates, but that there's a through line, you know, all the way through from the ad to the landing page that they're hitting to what their experience is like once they, you know, inquire with you, have a sales conversation with you, all of that, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:95",
   "ordinal": 95,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 439000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And so sometimes we can see that if one thing is off somewhere, right, that that's the leak in the funnel."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:96",
   "ordinal": 96,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 446000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: That's what's causing things not to work."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:97",
   "ordinal": 97,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 449000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And sometimes it can be on the front end with the ads, but more often than not, it can be beyond the ads, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:98",
   "ordinal": 98,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 456000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: What's being communicated on the landing page, what's even, you know, in the first email that people are receiving or the, you know, the pricing guide or packages or things like that, that they are checking out."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:99",
   "ordinal": 99,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 467000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So when we work with our clients through, through Elevate, it is a very high touch and holistic approach."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:100",
   "ordinal": 100,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 476000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So we are really focusing on the."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:101",
   "ordinal": 101,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 480000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Paid piece of it, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:102",
   "ordinal": 102,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 481000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: We're not doing anything as far as like your social media or anything like that."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:103",
   "ordinal": 103,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 484000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But we also understand how it all really kind of works together."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:104",
   "ordinal": 104,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 490000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And what's happening on the paid side is going to influence and can positively impact, you know, what you see as far as like organic social media engagement, things along those lines."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:105",
   "ordinal": 105,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 501000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:106",
   "ordinal": 106,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 502000,
   "text": "rose: mean, that all makes, I know that that is part of it, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:107",
   "ordinal": 107,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 505000,
   "text": "rose: You can't just run an ad and expect magic."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:108",
   "ordinal": 108,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 508000,
   "text": "rose: It has to be, it has to balance."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:109",
   "ordinal": 109,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 511000,
   "text": "rose: So that makes sense."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:110",
   "ordinal": 110,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 514000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:111",
   "ordinal": 111,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 514000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Awesome."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:112",
   "ordinal": 112,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 515000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:113",
   "ordinal": 113,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 515000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: The other thing that we see as well, and it's a, it's a question that I get a lot from some potential clients is like, should I be running Google ads?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:114",
   "ordinal": 114,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 522000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Should I be running Meta ads?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:115",
   "ordinal": 115,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 524000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Should I be running both?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:116",
   "ordinal": 116,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 525000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:117",
   "ordinal": 117,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 526000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And more often than not, we do see that when you are running to the both platforms in conjunction with one another, it has like a compounding effect, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:118",
   "ordinal": 118,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 536000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Because when you think about them, like they're, they're too."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:119",
   "ordinal": 119,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 540000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Completely different platforms."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:120",
   "ordinal": 120,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 541000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Google is a search engine."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:121",
   "ordinal": 121,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 542000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: People are going there with high intent, like looking for what they're looking for versus Meta being social media, you know, on Facebook and Instagram."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:122",
   "ordinal": 122,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 551000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: People are going there to be entertained, to connect with friends and family."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:123",
   "ordinal": 123,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 555000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So it's more of that disruptor marketing on that platform, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:124",
   "ordinal": 124,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 559000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Where the copy and the creative are so important to kind of grab their attention."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:125",
   "ordinal": 125,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 564000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But like psychologically, people who find you through a Google search versus people who find you through a Meta search, they can be in kind of a different state of mind, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:126",
   "ordinal": 126,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 573000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And can kind of behave differently."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:127",
   "ordinal": 127,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 576000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But, you know, we'll see too that somebody may find you on, you know, an Instagram ad and maybe they're not ready to click through right away."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:128",
   "ordinal": 128,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 585000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Or maybe they click over to your profile instead to do more research or they then Google you, you know, look up your reviews, things like that, or vice versa."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:129",
   "ordinal": 129,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 594000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Somebody finds you through a Google ad or organic Google search."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:130",
   "ordinal": 130,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 598000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: They're not ready to inquire."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:131",
   "ordinal": 131,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 600000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But when we have retargeting set up with the MetaPixel, then we can make it so that when they open up their Instagram or their Facebook, they're being served an ad from you so that you're really kind of like continuing to stay top of mind and stay in front of them."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:132",
   "ordinal": 132,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 615000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So it's a way to really kind of engineer your visibility."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:133",
   "ordinal": 133,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 618000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And we like to call it like a full funnel of ads."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:134",
   "ordinal": 134,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 621000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah, makes sense."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:135",
   "ordinal": 135,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 622000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:136",
   "ordinal": 136,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 623000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:137",
   "ordinal": 137,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 623000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:138",
   "ordinal": 138,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 624000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:139",
   "ordinal": 139,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 624000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Now, the other piece of it with Elevate is that we do create for our clients their ads traffic landing pages."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:140",
   "ordinal": 140,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 634000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So I'm not sure if you've experimented with this at all with the ads that you have run."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:141",
   "ordinal": 141,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 639000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Like, have you just been sending that traffic to like the homepage of your website or a specific page of your site?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:142",
   "ordinal": 142,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 645000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Or have you created a page specifically for that ads traffic?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:143",
   "ordinal": 143,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 650000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah, I have created specific landing pages for the ads."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:144",
   "ordinal": 144,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 654000,
   "text": "rose: I realized that like, part of it is that I kind of serve two markets in the sense of"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:145",
   "ordinal": 145,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 661000,
   "text": "rose: Like I have kind of a home base in Alaska."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:146",
   "ordinal": 146,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 663000,
   "text": "rose: So the page wasn't the right answer."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:147",
   "ordinal": 147,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 666000,
   "text": "rose: So I created landing page."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:148",
   "ordinal": 148,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 669000,
   "text": "rose: So there are my Colorado wedding photographer landing page is specific for the ads that I would like to run."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:149",
   "ordinal": 149,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 676000,
   "text": "rose: And I have kind of been tweaking it and adjusting it and updating it."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:150",
   "ordinal": 150,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 681000,
   "text": "rose: So can you walk me through what you, what you mean by creating these ads?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:151",
   "ordinal": 151,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 687000,
   "text": "rose: Yes."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:152",
   "ordinal": 152,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 688000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:153",
   "ordinal": 153,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 689000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So what we have found from working with clients for, uh, for years, right."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:154",
   "ordinal": 154,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 694000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: In a variety of different capacities where, you know, when some arrangements we just launched their ads and others, we are launching their ads and continuing to manage them."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:155",
   "ordinal": 155,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 703000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um, but our clients who we're seeing that have the most success, not only are we running their ads, but we also set up their funnels for them in our lead management platform called LeadLock."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:156",
   "ordinal": 156,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 716000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Which it's our version of go high level."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:157",
   "ordinal": 157,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 719000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I'm not sure."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:158",
   "ordinal": 158,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 720000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I if you're familiar with Go High Level or have heard of that platform before."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:159",
   "ordinal": 159,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 724000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It's a very robust platform, well-trusted kind of across a variety of different industries."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:160",
   "ordinal": 160,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 731000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: What we love about it is there are just so many cool things that you can do with it."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:161",
   "ordinal": 161,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 736000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But first and foremost, from an advertising perspective, is the attribution data that you can see there."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:162",
   "ordinal": 162,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 742000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: With the way that we can set up the forms and UTM parameters inside of your campaigns, we're able to see which specific leads are coming from your ads."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:163",
   "ordinal": 163,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 752000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And not just that it's come through an ad, right, or come through the ads traffic landing page, but that it's come through a Google ad or a Meta ad or this particular Meta ad creative."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:164",
   "ordinal": 164,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 763000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So it's really valuable being able to see exactly where they came in from and then, of course, what ends up happening with them, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:165",
   "ordinal": 165,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 774000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Their responsiveness, if they actually end up booking a call with you, turning into a book."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:166",
   "ordinal": 166,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 780000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So it's a platform that handles landing pages."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:167",
   "ordinal": 167,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 785000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So we would build an ads traffic landing page for you there, really kind of based on what we see that's kind of working well across the industry."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:168",
   "ordinal": 168,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 793000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: We can definitely kind of take into account what you currently have with your existing page, or if you really like love your page that you have right now, we could stick with that and just embed a LeadLock inquiry form on the page."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:169",
   "ordinal": 169,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 807000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um, but your, you know, leads would be captured through LeadLock and then everything would, would flow through there."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:170",
   "ordinal": 170,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 815000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um, so we set up inquiry, nurture, email, and text sequences for every lead that comes in."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:171",
   "ordinal": 171,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 823000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um, calendar can be connected to LeadLock as well."
  },
