   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:172",
   "ordinal": 172,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 827000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um, I assume that kind of part of your sales process is that you invite people to schedule a call or a zoom with you."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:173",
   "ordinal": 173,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 833000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Is that right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:174",
   "ordinal": 174,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 834000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:175",
   "ordinal": 175,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 835000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:176",
   "ordinal": 176,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 835000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:177",
   "ordinal": 177,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 835000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And I have workflows like that set up through Dubsado."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:178",
   "ordinal": 178,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 839000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: it sounds like it's."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:179",
   "ordinal": 179,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 839000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:180",
   "ordinal": 180,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 840000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Does it integrate through Dubsado or could I, is it a whole separate now, a whole separate platform to then?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:181",
   "ordinal": 181,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 845000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It is a separate platform."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:182",
   "ordinal": 182,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 848000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:183",
   "ordinal": 183,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 848000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And so we use Dubsado as well."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:184",
   "ordinal": 184,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 851000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: What we use Dubsado for is more strictly like the client management piece of it."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:185",
   "ordinal": 185,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 856000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So it's like, we'll use LeadLock for all of our marketing, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:186",
   "ordinal": 186,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 861000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So for example, you know, you inquired with us, the emails that you were receiving, texts that you were receiving, that's all coming through LeadLock, you know, your ability to be able to schedule a time on my calendar all through LeadLock, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:187",
   "ordinal": 187,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 873000,
   "text": "rose: Right."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:188",
   "ordinal": 188,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 874000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: But if and when we decide to work together, like the contract and invoice that I will send you will be from Dubsado, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:189",
   "ordinal": 189,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 881000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And you'll fill out the onboarding questionnaire there, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:190",
   "ordinal": 190,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 884000,
   "text": "rose: pre-receives any Dubsado."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:191",
   "ordinal": 191,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 886000,
   "text": "rose: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:192",
   "ordinal": 192,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 887000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Right."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:193",
   "ordinal": 193,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 887000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:194",
   "ordinal": 194,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 887000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: So we think of it as like a true lead management."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:195",
   "ordinal": 195,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 891000,
   "text": "rose: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:196",
   "ordinal": 196,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 892000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And, you know, we, we recommend it for our clients because it's what's able to give our team the visibility."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:197",
   "ordinal": 197,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 900000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And to seeing what's going on beyond just the ads, right?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:198",
   "ordinal": 198,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 903000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Because if you were to just run your ads in isolation, we may be able to look at the ad account and say, oh, the click through rate is amazing."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:199",
   "ordinal": 199,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 910000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And the cost per click is great."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:200",
   "ordinal": 200,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 911000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And we're seeing all of these, you know, inquiries happening, all of these conversions, but without being able to see who those leads actually are, are they responding to your emails and text messages?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:201",
   "ordinal": 201,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 923000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Are they actually booking calls?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:202",
   "ordinal": 202,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 925000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Are they actually becoming booked clients?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:203",
   "ordinal": 203,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 926000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: We're really only able to look at one piece of the puzzle."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:204",
   "ordinal": 204,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 931000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: And the ads piece, of course, is important, but us being able to have that full visibility is what gives us the ability to really be able to drive great results."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:205",
   "ordinal": 205,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 941000,
   "text": "rose: Okay."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:206",
   "ordinal": 206,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 942000,
   "text": "rose: Yeah."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:207",
   "ordinal": 207,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 943000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: I mean, that makes sense."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:208",
   "ordinal": 208,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 943000,
   "text": "rose: On one hand, I'm like, gosh, I mean, I, I'm not, and maybe this is a problem you'll fix for me, but I'm not being flooded with leads such that like it's a, now I know what you're saying is more on the Davis side."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:209",
   "ordinal": 209,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 957000,
   "text": "rose: So I understand that, but like, I'm not getting 30 leads a month."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:210",
   "ordinal": 210,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 960000,
   "text": "rose: I'm getting five, maybe 10."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:211",
   "ordinal": 211,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 963000,
   "text": "rose: So, but I recognize that understanding the source of the lead is all helpful in retargeting."
  },
