   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:212",
   "ordinal": 212,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 973000,
   "text": "rose: So I suppose I'd be interested in it, in the lead."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:213",
   "ordinal": 213,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 976000,
   "text": "rose: I just sort of am like, capacity wise, like, it's not like I can't, I can't send them a text."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:214",
   "ordinal": 214,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 982000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Right."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:215",
   "ordinal": 215,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 983000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: It's an automated system, but maybe that's getting ahead of the game."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:216",
   "ordinal": 216,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 987000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: No, I totally hear what you're saying."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:217",
   "ordinal": 217,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 989000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: That's, that's valid, right?"
  },
