   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:224",
   "ordinal": 224,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 1025000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Then they get an email with that link to book."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:225",
   "ordinal": 225,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1029000,
   "text": "rose: If they don't book the call, like within 24 hours, it sends another email, like two days later being like, hey, I'd love to get you on the schedule, that kind of thing."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:226",
   "ordinal": 226,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1040000,
   "text": "rose: Um, usually if they do book a call quickly, and obviously they're, they're primed to book, then it's like a kind of a different series of like, well, let's get this call scheduled quickly."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:227",
   "ordinal": 227,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1052000,
   "text": "rose: Let's have this conversation."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:228",
   "ordinal": 228,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1054000,
   "text": "rose: Um, and then there's like a pricing guide and everything that, that comes into that."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:229",
   "ordinal": 229,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1059000,
   "text": "rose: Um, so I just forgot what I was about to say."
  },
