   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:230",
   "ordinal": 230,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1065000,
   "text": "rose: Um, usually right now, you know, my bookings have been strange in the sense that I get good leads on the phone or something, and then they decide to go in a different direction, or I just don't hear from them again."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:231",
   "ordinal": 231,
   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 1079000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Um."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:232",
   "ordinal": 232,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1081000,
   "text": "rose: So yes, does that kind of answer kind of the workflow question?"
  },
