   "speaker": "Whitney Hodges",
   "speaker_role": "staff",
   "start_ms": 1092000,
   "text": "Whitney Hodges: Like, you have a specific like workflow to kind of like warm them up prior to the call happening with you?"
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:237",
   "ordinal": 237,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1098000,
   "text": "rose: Other than the sort of, here's a pricing guide."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:238",
   "ordinal": 238,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1101000,
   "text": "rose: Like I look forward to like speaking with you."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:239",
   "ordinal": 239,
   "speaker": "rose",
   "speaker_role": "prospect",
   "start_ms": 1105000,
   "text": "rose: There really isn't more, that's the email that comes prior to the phone call."
  },
  {
   "passage_id": "fathom:190540576:span:240",
